  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_eve01",
      "hash64": "5ED857C6313F15AD",
      "text": "我本來想用寶可夢洗澡澡幫臭臭泥洗澡，\\n但牠看起來很不樂意！Why？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_eve02",
      "hash64": "5ED854C6313F1094",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_eve03",
      "hash64": "5ED855C6313F1247",
      "text": "畫得好的畫看起來就像照片一樣！\\n那樣的話，用相機App拍照不就好了？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_eve04",
      "hash64": "5ED852C6313F0D2E",
      "text": "照片中呈現不出來的技巧！\\n通通濃縮在畫裡面！\\r\\n……反之亦然！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_eve05",
      "hash64": "5ED853C6313F0EE1",
      "text": "真是優美的造型……\\n美到連寶可夢都會嫉妒的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_eve06",
      "hash64": "5ED850C6313F09C8",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_eve07",
      "hash64": "5ED851C6313F0B7B",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_ni04",
      "hash64": "F9971A6B036FEA8D",
      "text": "雖然花蓓蓓有很多種顏色，\\n但我喜歡紅色的花蓓蓓！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_room02_ni08",
      "hash64": "F9970E6B036FD629",
      "text": "這個雕像栩栩如生，\\n讓人可以感受到它的柔軟。\\r\\n真是不可思議的作品。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
